From 6122eafee53b0a88685296d9e56083352bfe22e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kasniya <36neelansh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:35:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(sculk): keep described states and interned ids per
 region across runs

A region sees about three sculk runs that get past can_spread_from, and each
described its states and interned its write states afresh. The per-StateKey
Info cache and the write ids now live in a per-feature memo tagged with the
region's serial; interning order is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
